{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Venusville</strong>, you lead the first expedition to colonize the skies of Venus \u2014 a place where the ground is death, and only the clouds can sustain life.<br>Your mission: design, expand, and maintain a self-sufficient city suspended in the most hostile atmosphere in the solar system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the <strong>architect and commander</strong> of a living city. Every decision \u2014 where to build, what to produce, how to balance weight and buoyancy \u2014 determines whether your colony soars or sinks.<br>Manage colonists and robotic workers, harness solar and thermal power, extract resources from corrosive clouds, and navigate the endless storms that sweep across the planet.<br>Will your city endure the planet\u2019s wrath\u2026 or vanish beneath the clouds forever? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/extras/45d870d4e5e6c3f2b1dc5d06af8b25df.poster.avif?t=1772117783\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/extras/45d870d4e5e6c3f2b1dc5d06af8b25df.webm?t=1772117783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/extras/45d870d4e5e6c3f2b1dc5d06af8b25df.mp4?t=1772117783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc65 Colonist &amp; Robot City Building</strong> <br>Lead colonists in constructing infrastructure, processing resources, farming food, and maintaining systems \u2014 supported by worker, builder, and transport robots. Keep your people fed, rested, and satisfied to unlock efficiency and prevent unrest. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/extras/0f333a51e2094e9230ce135588e6ada4.poster.avif?t=1772117783\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/extras/0f333a51e2094e9230ce135588e6ada4.webm?t=1772117783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/extras/0f333a51e2094e9230ce135588e6ada4.mp4?t=1772117783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\u2696 Buoyancy &amp; Balance</strong> <br>Each module, battery, engine, and solar array has its own weight and buoyancy. Strategic placement and constant adjustments are essential to maintain equilibrium and avoid deadly tilts or descent into extreme pressure zones. <br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf2a Planetary Mobility &amp; Exploration</strong> <br>From day one, your city drifts on Venus\u2019 winds (~4-day circumnavigation near equator). Once engines unlock full mobility, you can control movement across latitudes and altitudes. Use scanning towers and orbiting satellites in the late game to detect storms, resource concentrations (e.g. FeCl\u2083, H\u2082O, H\u2082), and anomalies. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/extras/6db3977ec72be63a85df828ba69640e7.poster.avif?t=1772117783\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/extras/6db3977ec72be63a85df828ba69640e7.webm?t=1772117783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/extras/6db3977ec72be63a85df828ba69640e7.mp4?t=1772117783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0b Power Management</strong><br> Harness solar energy and Stirling engines driven by altitude temperature differentials. Design robust power grids and battery networks so your colony can survive night, storms, and system overloads. <br><br><strong>\u2601 Atmospheric Resource Extraction</strong> <br>Mine raw gases and aerosols from the clouds, then refine them into usable materials \u2014 sulphur-based plastics, carbons, chemicals, and metals \u2014 to feed your production chains.<br><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/extras/94f8b6048c7876e5ac9669398e4adbca.poster.avif?t=1772117783\" width=620 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/extras/94f8b6048c7876e5ac9669398e4adbca.webm?t=1772117783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/extras/94f8b6048c7876e5ac9669398e4adbca.mp4?t=1772117783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>\ud83c\udfd7 Manufacture Advanced Materials</strong> <br>Transform refined materials into high-end components: graphene, nanotubes, diamond-based chips, electronics \u2014 enabling expansion into advanced modules and technologies. <br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf21 Environmental Challenges</strong> <br>Brave acid clouds, lightning, extreme temperature shifts, wind shear, storms, fires, and pressure fluctuations. These hazards threaten system stability, structural integrity, and colonist survival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/extras/68f27d9012bd2c711d36188010d095f1.poster.avif?t=1772117783\" width=620 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/extras/68f27d9012bd2c711d36188010d095f1.webm?t=1772117783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/extras/68f27d9012bd2c711d36188010d095f1.mp4?t=1772117783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2971520?t=1772117783","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/28d706639211d2643b412c056232b41bd5e02591/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772117783","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/82a94d32d09403b0341708ec027dbbf1a1b4fff4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772117783","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/82a94d32d09403b0341708ec027dbbf1a1b4fff4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772117783","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3599110,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Venusville</strong>, you lead the first expedition to colonize the skies of Venus \u2014 a place where the ground is death, and only the clouds can sustain life.<br>Your mission: design, expand, and maintain a self-sufficient city suspended in the most hostile atmosphere in the solar system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the <strong>architect and commander</strong> of a living city. Every decision \u2014 where to build, what to produce, how to balance weight and buoyancy \u2014 determines whether your colony soars or sinks.<br>Manage colonists and robotic workers, harness solar and thermal power, extract resources from corrosive clouds, and navigate the endless storms that sweep across the planet.<br>Will your city endure the planet\u2019s wrath\u2026 or vanish beneath the clouds forever? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" au