ty drifts on Venus\u2019 winds (~4-day circumnavigation near equator). Once engines unlock full mobility, you can control movement across latitudes and altitudes. Use scanning towers and orbiting satellites in the late game to detect storms, resource concentrations (e.g. FeCl\u2083, H\u2082O, H\u2082), and anomalies. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/extras/6db3977ec72be63a85df828ba69640e7.poster.avif?t=1772117783\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/extras/6db3977ec72be63a85df828ba69640e7.webm?t=1772117783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/extras/6db3977ec72be63a85df828ba69640e7.mp4?t=1772117783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0b Power Management</strong><br> Harness solar energy and Stirling engines driven by altitude temperature differentials. Design robust power grids and battery networks so your colony can survive night, storms, and system overloads. <br><br><strong>\u2601 Atmospheric Resource Extraction</strong> <br>Mine raw gases and aerosols from the clouds, then refine them into usable materials \u2014 sulphur-based plastics, carbons, chemicals, and metals \u2014 to feed your production chains.<br><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/extras/94f8b6048c7876e5ac9669398e4adbca.poster.avif?t=1772117783\" width=620 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/extras/94f8b6048c7876e5ac9669398e4adbca.webm?t=1772117783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/extras/94f8b6048c7876e5ac9669398e4adbca.mp4?t=1772117783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>\ud83c\udfd7 Manufacture Advanced Materials</strong> <br>Transform refined materials into high-end components: graphene, nanotubes, diamond-based chips, electronics \u2014 enabling expansion into advanced modules and technologies. <br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf21 Environmental Challenges</strong> <br>Brave acid clouds, lightning, extreme temperature shifts, wind shear, storms, fires, and pressure fluctuations. These hazards threaten system stability, structural integrity, and colonist survival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/extras/68f27d9012bd2c711d36188010d095f1.poster.avif?t=1772117783\" width=620 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/extras/68f27d9012bd2c711d36188010d095f1.webm?t=1772117783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/extras/68f27d9012bd2c711d36188010d095f1.mp4?t=1772117783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Orbit Start Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971520/9513ea4b9789c439a50658a9fff0a3596fe982ee/header.jpg?t=1772117783","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2971520/856140/ce29b